    whyEn: 'The similarity between Noah and Uta-napishti (Gilgamesh) suggests a common memory of a great flood. This does not invalidate the Bible — on the contrary, it shows that the biblical narrative gives unique theological meaning (covenant, mercy) to a real event.',
